# chat works, mute self, chat is refused with the explanation, unmute, chat works again
chat before mute
expect before mute
cmd mute Tester
expect Muted Tester
expect You have been muted
chat secretword while muted
expect You are muted and cannot send messages.
expect-none secretword
cmd unmute Tester
expect Unmuted Tester
chat after unmute
expect after unmute
cmd unmute Tester
expect Tester is not muted.
